.jpg", "id": 0, "text": "", "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn4le10ob04re2img05.jpg", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: It's my first day in Amsterdam. I was wondering if you could tell me what I should go see first.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Local Woman</span>: Do you like flowers and gardens?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure, who doesn't?", "time": "1"}, {"image": "engenn4le10ob04re2img01.jpg", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Local Woman</span>: Then you should definitely go to the flower market, even on a cold foggy day like today. It will leave a good impression.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Maybe I could buy some gifts for the gang back in Cambridge. What else could I do?<br>", "time": "12000"}, {"image": "engenn4le10ob04re2img02.jpg", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Local Woman</span>: You must try our Pannekoek! They are delicious. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: What are those?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Local Woman</span>: They are a type of salty pancake. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Interesting.<br>", "time": "27000"}, {"image": "engenn4le10ob04re2img03.jpg", "id": 4, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Local Woman</span>:  Do you believe in ghosts?<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sure, I do. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Local Woman</span>:  Amsterdam has a lot of ghosts. Why do you think this city has so many canals? Because ghosts can't cross water. Kidding aside, you might consider the  ghost tour of Amsterdam.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Sally</span>: Sounds good. You gave me a lot of ideas.", "time": "38000"}], "coverimg": "engenn4le10ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": ""}, {"id": 3, "contents": [{"value": {"audiosrc": "engenn4le10ob04re5aud01", "images": [], "coverimg": "engenn4le10ob04re2img01.jpg"}, "type": "picture"}], "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": 